cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Multi-agent water-distribution simulator and identity evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Discrete-event multi-agent simulator for priority-aware water distribution
  at multiple dispensing points (configurations B0-B5 and an oracle O1), with
  parameter-sharing PPO, fault-injection and failure-recovery experiments, a
  face-route failure sensitivity analysis, and the identity-evaluation script
  (LFW verification and open-set identification with a MobileFaceNet pipeline)
  behind the results tables of the accompanying paper.
